 serve them through our online ticketing system. (A small fee applies.) Walk
 -ups are also welcome on the day of the show if seating is available.\n\nSe
 ptember 2 lineup: TBA\n\nIf you're interested in performing at the open mic
  night\, please read the instructions at this linked page.\n\nAll sales are
  final. Refunds and exchanges are offered only when a show is canceled or r
 escheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to attend 
