  event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two-item minimum per customer. This can 
 be any combination of food items or beverages. Bottled water and soft drink
 s count as items. (The two-item minimum does not apply to comedy classes.)\
 n\nCoupons or passes for free admission cannot be used for a show listed as
